## Internal working files -- deliberately not part of this public repository
CLAUDE.md
docs/
.serena/
# `dotnet skills` vendors the Microsoft skill catalog into an agent root.
# Claude Code reads `.claude/skills/`; `.github/skills/` is where the tool
# auto-detects to in this repo, so both paths can hold a copy.
# Not published from here: the auto-state file records an absolute local path,
# and several SKILL.md declare no license at all. Re-creatable with one
# command, so run it locally instead of expecting a clone to carry it.
.github/skills/
.claude/
